Guacamole
1
Mashed avocados with shallot, tomato, lime and spices.

---
Avocados|3|pcs
Shallot|1|pcs
Tomatoes|1|pcs
Lime|1|pcs
Salt|1|pinch
Tabasco|3|drops
Cumin|1|heaped pinch
Coriander leaves|1|tbsp

---
Peel and mash the avocado flesh with a fork.
Finely chop the shallot and tomato. Juice the lime.
Mix avocados, shallot, tomato, lime juice, salt, Tabasco (or cayenne), cumin and coriander.
Serve promptly.

---
